{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>PandaMusic 是一款本地音樂與影片 MV 播放器，適合擁有個人音樂、Podcast、講座或錄音收藏的用戶。它不設熱門歌單或帳戶綁定，以檔案、相片和 AirDrop 傳入的內容為媒體庫來源。App 原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>本地媒體庫與播放功能</h2>\n<p>PandaMusic 可從檔案 App、相片、AirDrop 與「Open in…」匯入音樂、影片 MV 或其他媒體，集中存放於裝置。資料夾可自訂封面、背景和簡介，主畫面可拖曳排序，列表亦能調整曲目順序。播放方面支援背景播放、迷你播放器、列表循環、隨機播放、單曲循環，並可自動轉換難解格式及從影片抽取音訊。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-761-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-762-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-763-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-764-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-765-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-766-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：PandaMusic</li>\n<li>應用類別：Music</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T00:50:19.587119+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":328,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}